        <mxCell id="_x0" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#1F4E79&quot;&gt;STATIC PATH&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;1&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; Handler opens app.&amp;lt;domain&amp;gt;&lt;br&gt;2&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; Over Direct Connect to the private&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; API Gateway (VPC endpoint)&lt;br&gt;3&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; Gateway proxies /app to S3&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; (deviation: no Fargate web tier)&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; Bundle returned; SPA starts&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#1F4E79&quot;&gt;AUTHENTICATION&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;4&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; MSAL.js: authorization code + PKCE&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; Azure AD uses the device PRT; no&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; prompt on a HIG-joined device&lt;br&gt;5&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; JWT access token with claims&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#1F4E79&quot;&gt;API AUTHORIZATION&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;6&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; GET /summary/{claim}, bearer token&lt;br&gt;7&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; Gateway invokes Lambda Authorizer&lt;br&gt;7a&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;JWKS from Azure AD (cached); checks&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; signature, iss, aud, exp, group&lt;br&gt;7b&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;ENT#&amp;lt;user&amp;gt; and CLAIM#&amp;lt;id&amp;gt; read&lt;br&gt;7c&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;IAM policy Allow / Deny returned&lt;br&gt;8&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; Deny: 401/403 to the SPA&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#1F4E79&quot;&gt;BUSINESS CALL&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;9&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; Allow: API Lambda invoked directly&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; (no VPC Link; Lambda backend)&lt;br&gt;10&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Eligibility, version compare, lock,&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; stored summary or enqueue&lt;br&gt;11&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;200 summary or 202 queued&lt;br&gt;12&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;SPA renders; polls if queued&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#1F4E79&quot;&gt;NOTES&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Dashed arrows are responses.&lt;br&gt;Token validation is stateless; only&lt;br&gt;the JWKS document is cached.&lt;br&gt;The PRT is never seen by the SPA.&lt;br&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=2;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#9AA5B1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=8;fontSize=11;fontColor=#222222;fontFamily=Arial;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1400" y="130" width="270" height="690" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
